---
---
<section class="py-24 bg-premium-dark border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <p class="text-gold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-xs font-semibold mb-4">
        Science-Backed
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-4">
        Training, nutrition, and recovery in perfect sync.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        We blend data, coaching intuition, and real-time feedback to keep you progressing without extremes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      <div class="bg-black/60 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gold/60 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(212,175,55,0.1)] transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gold mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold">Training intelligence</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Structured phases, impeccable form, and tempo control to build strength that lasts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-black/60 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gold/60 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(212,175,55,0.1)] transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gold mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"></path><path d="M12 5 9.04 7.96a2.17 2.17 0 0 0 0 3.08v0c.82.82 2.13.85 3 .07l2.07-1.9"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold">Nutrition strategy</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Balanced fueling that supports cognition, performance, and hormonal health—no crash diets.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-black/60 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gold/60 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(212,175,55,0.1)] transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gold mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z"></path><path d="M19 3v4"></path><path d="M21 5h-4"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold">Recovery as a skill</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Sleep, breathwork, and mobility cues that make adaptation faster and injuries rarer.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
